<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>로또 번호 추천기</title>

<style>
    body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        text-align: center;
        background: #f4f4f4;
        padding: 50px;
    }

    .container {
        max-width: 500px;
        margin: auto;
        background: white;
        padding: 30px;
        border-radius: 15px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }

    h1 {
        color: #333;
    }

    button {
        padding: 12px 24px;
        font-size: 18px;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: #007bff;
        color: white;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: 0.3s;
    }

    button:hover {
        background: #0056b3;
    }

    .numbers {
        margin-top: 30px;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 10px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .ball {
        width: 55px;
        height: 55px;
        line-height: 55px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        color: white;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 20px;
    }

    .yellow { background: #fbc400; }
    .blue { background: #4aa8ff; }
    .red { background: #ff5b5b; }
    .gray { background: #888; }
    .green { background: #4caf50; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <h1>🎲 로또 번호 추천기</h1>
    <p>버튼을 눌러 행운의 번호를 받아보세요!</p>

    <button onclick="generateLotto()">번호 추천받기</button>

    <div class="numbers" id="numbers"></div>
</div>

<script>
function getColor(num) {
    if (num <= 10) return "yellow";
    if (num <= 20) return "blue";
    if (num <= 30) return "red";
    if (num <= 40) return "gray";
    return "green";
}

function generateLotto() {
    let numbers = [];

    while (numbers.length < 6) {
        let randomNum = Math.floor(Math.random() * 45) + 1;

        if (!numbers.includes(randomNum)) {
            numbers.push(randomNum);
        }
    }

    numbers.sort((a, b) => a - b);

    const container = document.getElementById("numbers");
    container.innerHTML = "";

    numbers.forEach(num => {
        const ball = document.createElement("div");
        ball.className = `ball ${getColor(num)}`;
        ball.textContent = num;
        container.appendChild(ball);
    });
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
